{
  "doc": "stages/writers.copc.rst: 'The **COPC Writer** supports writing to `COPC format`_ files.' and stages/readers.copc.rst: 'The **COPC Reader** supports reading from `COPC format`_ files.' -- the step-04 milestone still runs: a COPC write/read round trip keeps the point count and the X/Y/Z of the 10x10x10 lattice. Asserted order-independently, because the order a COPC file stores its points in is what step 05 changes.",
  "files": {
